sdk-pinned.remediation:
Pin the SDK in a `global.json` at the root of the checkout, and stop it from rolling forward:

```json
{
  "sdk": {
    "version": "8.0.204",
    "rollForward": "disable"
  }
}
```

Any `rollForward` policy other than `disable` lets a newer SDK on the runner take over the build, so `global.json` on its own is not a pin. Without the pin, MSBuild and compiler changes arrive with the runner image instead of with a commit someone reviewed.
